---
title: sd MF-01c: Platform Admin Records Posting Fee or Sourcing Deposit Transfer
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor AD as Platform Admin
  participant FE as Web App (HRConnect-FE)
  participant API as Job / Finance Endpoints
  participant H as RecordFeePayment Handlers
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor CL as Client Company User
  AD->>FE: Open Billing Queue & enter bank transfer reference
  FE->>API: POST /jobs/{id}/posting-fee/pay or /admin/service-fees/{id}/record-payment
  API->>H: Send(RecordPaymentCommand)
  alt Missing payment reference or Fee not PENDING
    H-->>API: Throw BadRequest / ConflictException
    API-->>FE: 400 Bad Request / 409 Conflict
  else Valid Payment Reference
    H->>DB: Mark Fee -> PAID (PaidAt, PaymentReference)
    H->>DB: Update Job PENDING_PAYMENT -> ACTIVE (PostedAt) & AuditLog
    H-->>CL: Send Real-time Notification: Job is now ACTIVE
    H-->>API: Return PaymentRecordedResponse
    API-->>FE: 200 OK (Job Published)
  end
